    "craft_auto_slider_chP8En": {
      "type": "Craft-Auto-Slider",
      "blocks": {
        "story_slide_wJ66V3": {
          "type": "story_slide",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Your Story, Our Craft",
            "content": "<p>Superior craftsmanship, thoughtful customisation, and premium, eco-conscious materials are the foundation of every Cullen ring. The rest is shaped by you.</p><p>We're here to collaborate — guiding you through each step to ensure your custom ring reflects everything you envisioned. But the journey doesn't end at the final polish.</p><p>We offer lifetime servicing, repairs, and ongoing aftercare, so your ring holds its meaning for decades to come.</p>",
            "media_type": "image",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_design_85.png",
            "video_url": "",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_url": ""
          }
        },
        "story_slide_dQeG3i": {
          "type": "story_slide",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ethically Sourced Materials",
            "content": "<p>Every gemstone and precious metal we select meets strict ethical standards. Our commitment to sustainability ensures beauty without compromise.</p><p>From lab-grown diamonds to recycled gold, we prioritize transparency in every piece we create.</p>",
            "media_type": "video",
            "video_native": "shopify://files/videos/124bd5a7251b47bcb1bcbb546cd4afb6.HD-1080p-2.5Mbps-91398240 (online-video-cutter.com).mp4",
            "video_url": "",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_url": ""
          }
        },
        "story_slide_XCPnPB": {
          "type": "story_slide",
